 {'idx': 9, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'Gmina Osina is a rural gmina (administrative district) in Goleniów County, West Pomeranian Voivodeship, in north-western Poland. Its seat is the village of Osina, which lies approximately north-east of Goleniów and north-east of the regional capital Szczecin.', 'title': 'Gmina Osina'}
