 {'idx': 7, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'Ornament Records is a German record label set up in 1972 by Siegfried A. "Ziggy" Christmann. It initially specialised in issuing live recordings of blues artists who were touring Germany. Soon the label started releasing jazz and German (especially Moselle Franconian) folk music as well.', 'title': 'Ornament Records'}
