 {'idx': 2, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'Bandar-e Olya (, also Romanized as Bāndar-e ‘Olyā and Bondar-e ‘Olyā; also known as Bondar-e Bālā) is a village in Kuhestan Rural District, Kelardasht District, Chalus County, Mazandaran Province, Iran. At the 2006 census, its population was 70, in 21 families.', 'title': 'Bandar-e Olya'}
