 {'idx': 9, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'Anil Devgan is the son of Veeru Devgan, brother of actor Ajay Devgan, and brother-in-law of actress Kajol. Anil Devgan has also tried his hand with directing, and has directed his brother in two of his films: Raju Chacha and Blackmail (2005 film).', 'title': 'Anil Devgan'}
