 {'idx': 12, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'Bjørnar Julius Olsen (born 2 January 1958, Finnmark, Norway) is professor at the University of Tromsø. He is a Norwegian archaeologist who specializes in archaeological theory, material culture, museology, northern/Arctic archaeology. Olsen is a prominent figure in the turn to things, including symmetrical archaeology.', 'title': 'Bjørnar Olsen'}
